# Equal delivered charge gives equal modeled water-electrolysis production despite different current schedules
register lv3
add v1 water 250mL
add v1 KNO3 0.001mol
electrolyse v1 0.2A 60s
new
add v2 water 250mL
add v2 KNO3 0.001mol
electrolyse v2 0.1A 120s
new
add v3 water 250mL
add v3 KNO3 0.001mol
electrolyse v3 0.2A 30s
electrolyse v3 0.2A 30s
inspect v1
inspect v2
inspect v3
inspect
